{!Contact.FirstName},<br /><br />

Thank you for your interest in the graduate certificate in online teaching for grades k-12 at ASU’s Mary Lou Fulton Teachers College. This program prepares current K-12 teachers to teach in an online environment and become leaders in the development, implementation and evaluation of online programs.<br/><br/>

My name is <a href=mailto:donna.parris@asu.edu?Subject=Mary%20Lou%20Fulton%20Request%20For%20Information target=”_top”>Donna Parris</a> and I am here to answer any questions you have about the program and to assist you during the application process. To get the most up-to-date program information, attend one of our upcoming information sessions. We offer both on-campus and online sessions for your convenience, some of which include faculty participation. <a href=https://education.asu.edu/resources/events target=”_blank”>Register now</a> to reserve your spot for an information session as soon as possible. Please also take a look at the <a href=" https://education.asu.edu/sites/default/files/Online-Teaching-for-Grades-K-12-Program-Guide_0.pdf
" target="_blank">program guide</a> for specifics on program requirements, the application process and funding information.<br/><br/>

My primary goal is to provide you with the support and resources you will need in pursuing  your graduate education. Here are a few more links I think will be helpful for you:<br /><br />

<a href=https://education.asu.edu/sites/default/files/Graduate-Program-Application-Deadlines.pdf>Mary Lou Fulton Teachers college Programs: Application Deadlines</a><br />
<a href="http://education.asu.edu/graduate-programs-how-apply">Mary Lou Fulton Teachers College Programs: How to Apply</a><br />
<a href="http://education.asu.edu/resources/scholarships">Mary Lou Fulton Teachers College Scholarship Information</ a><br />
<a href="https://students.asu.edu/graduate?destination=node/16972">ASU Graduate Admissions Services</ a><br />
<a href="https://students.asu.edu/graduate/apply">Applying to Graduate Studies</ a><br />
<a href="https://students.asu.edu/graduate/standards">Admission Standards</ a><br />
<a href="https://students.asu.edu/graduate/finances">Financing Your Graduate Education</a><br />
<a href="https://students.asu.edu/tuition">Tuition and Fees/Tuition Estimator</a><br /><br />

If you have any questions regarding the application process, please contact me and I will be happy to work with you or connect you with other university resources. <br /><br />

I hope to see or hear from you soon!<br />
Kindest regards,<br /><br /></font>

